{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261111/photo/bkn-20261111155800001-1111_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261111161349\"/><p>事主送院救治。</p><p>將軍澳發生工業意外。今午(11日)2時57分，有市民報案，指一名男子在穎禮路一車房維修私家車期間，該私家車突然墮下，他閃避不及被車砸中頭部，當場陷入昏迷。救護車接報趕至，隨即將事主送往將軍澳醫院搶救。事故原因待查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:55:13.857708+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:48:38.367317+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:48:38.367317+00:00","content_hash":"2b35c64c7327c425d983ff54666c30dbe75c216e968d7547b07e7b99f56b0c67","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}